@prefix : <http://www.w3id.org/HEXMLPO/ontology#> .
@prefix xmlpo: <http://www.w3id.org/xmlpo/ontology#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix gufo: <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#> .
@base <http://www.w3id.org/HEXMLPO/ontology#> .

<http://www.w3id.org/hexmlpo/instances>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports
        <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#> ,
        <http://www.w3id.org/xmlpo/ontology> ,
        <http://www.w3id.org/HEXMLPO/ontology> ;
    dcterms:title "HEXMLPO instances: stakeholder profiles and their explanation needs"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Individuals for HEXMLPO: prototypical stakeholder profiles, knowledge levels, explanation modalities, goals and types, quality criteria, and the priority, preference, alignment and access relators that connect them."@en ;
    dcterms:creator <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3872-8046> ;
    dcterms:publisher <https://ror.org/006hf6230> .


### XAIStakeholder

:DecisionSubjectProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :DecisionSubject .

:DomainExpertProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainExpert .

:TechnicalCreatorProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalCreator .

:OperationalUserProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :OperationalUser .

:OrganisationalComplianceOverseerProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :OrganisationalComplianceOverseer .

:ResearcherTheoristProfile a owl:NamedIndividual , :ResearcherTheorist .


### Knowledge

:DecisionSubjectDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Basic ;
    gufo:inheresIn :DecisionSubjectProfile .

:DecisionSubjectTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Basic ;
    gufo:inheresIn :DecisionSubjectProfile .

:DomainExpertDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Expert ;
    gufo:inheresIn :DomainExpertProfile .

:DomainExpertTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Intermediate ;
    gufo:inheresIn :DomainExpertProfile .

:TechnicalCreatorDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Intermediate ;
    gufo:inheresIn :TechnicalCreatorProfile .

:TechnicalCreatorTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Expert ;
    gufo:inheresIn :TechnicalCreatorProfile .

:OperationalUserDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Advanced ;
    gufo:inheresIn :OperationalUserProfile .

:OperationalUserTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Intermediate ;
    gufo:inheresIn :OperationalUserProfile .

:ComplianceDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Advanced ;
    gufo:inheresIn :OrganisationalComplianceOverseerProfile .

:ComplianceTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Intermediate ;
    gufo:inheresIn :OrganisationalComplianceOverseerProfile .

:ResearcherDomainKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :DomainKnowledge ;
    :level :Advanced ;
    gufo:inheresIn :ResearcherTheoristProfile .

:ResearcherTechnicalKnowledge
    a owl:NamedIndividual , :TechnicalKnowledge ;
    :level :Expert ;
    gufo:inheresIn :ResearcherTheoristProfile .


### Explanation Modalities

:TextualExplanation
    a owl:NamedIndividual , xmlpo:ExplanationModality ;
    :format :Textual .

:VisualExplanation
    a owl:NamedIndividual , xmlpo:ExplanationModality ;
    :format :Visual .

:NumericalExplanation
    a owl:NamedIndividual , xmlpo:ExplanationModality ;
    :format :Numerical .

:RuleExplanation
    a owl:NamedIndividual , xmlpo:ExplanationModality ;
    :format :Rule .


### Explanation Goals

:Audit a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:CalibrateTrust a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:Contest a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:DecisionSupport a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:Discover a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:Improve a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:Justify a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .

:Persuade a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationGoal .


### Explanation Types

:CaseBasedExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :CaseBasedExplanation .

:ContextualExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :ContextualExplanation .

:ContrastiveExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :ContrastiveExplanation .

:CounterfactualExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :CounterfactualExplanation .

:EverydayExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :EverydayExplanation .

:ScientificExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :ScientificExplanation .

:SimulationBasedExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :SimulationBasedExplanation .

:StatisticalExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :StatisticalExplanation .

:TraceBasedExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :TraceBasedExplanation .

:DataExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :DataExplanation .

:RationaleExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :RationaleExplanation .

:SafetyAndPerformanceExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :SafetyAndPerformanceExplanation .

:ImpactExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :ImpactExplanation .

:FairnessExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :FairnessExplanation .

:ResponsibilityExplanationType a owl:NamedIndividual , :ResponsibilityExplanation .


### Explanation Qualities

:Correctness a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Completeness a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Consistency a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Continuity a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Contrastivity a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:CovariateComplexity a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Compactness a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Composition a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Confidence a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Context a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Coherence a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:Controllability a owl:NamedIndividual , :ExplanationQuality .

:ComprehensibilityPerspective
    :evaluatesWithRespectTo
        :CovariateComplexity,
        :Confidence,
        :Coherence,
        :Context .

:FidelityPerspective
    :evaluatesWithRespectTo
        :Correctness,
        :Completeness,
        :Consistency .


